{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_037_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6e59623732863abc6528a5865c0d9c29f9457c4d668a65f2f448bd64767f5b72",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d93c4fe2e2a4f5514f84efdfd17cfc45527a988ea47e5d42c1072b1829e09d",
      "text": "制作人酱。\n情人节巧克力，谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:195d13d960a38b6bf62b0c70763773842af680469755713961ea56ebfdc752b8",
      "text": "而且还陪我顺道去买了彩票……嘿嘿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e33bb553ffc59f90a23cbae7b4524a4949d29f8ad82294b8ab853f4e06df29a",
      "text": "哪里哪里。\n要是彩票能中奖就好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c0c618c74d6677673e2d55cc6f2905a4c5ccff4d538e1c19a781c65115fd35",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱的\n福气可是非同小可的哟？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0b8e450ce4dc7e8ce30a02a902152a89a1ff1f37ad3c09b44049e768764d42e",
      "text": "毕竟以前也是有前例的嘛。\n那次可真是吓了我一大跳啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c759d828e124d069882ad6c729bbef6b6a2233b657721b2c3abb8de2fa067cee",
      "text": "原来还有过这种事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a003645cd62319284ebb7f3b50563be61b7b059a3fc2a28cf575d923e0d6c51e",
      "text": "啊——要是给你带来压力了我先道个歉哈？\n对我来说你就是福神一样的存在啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1f8db379c32f1de85a033235d5c45f42d7e61e240b5289c23757358631f932",
      "text": "好啦，趁早把名为彩票的梦想拿到手，\n回事务所去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d089e0fe3183392559983d5313b78b52c2f4ef95ed9cc6541bfe5f12130bebd7",
      "text": "今天不光有制作人酱在，\n还有灵验无比的巧克力在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_23:5_01_037_23_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccd4e1ac4753f79679422fc3277e2c77e08a20f7187cb9f3f6be9dd4ee6e00c9",
      "text": "趁着难得的好运还没消散我可得赶紧去买好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
